  year    = {2015},
  note    = {THE DIRECT HIT. Section 3.2 uses log(1+earn75) as a RHS regressor as its cautionary example on
             the LaLonde data: the imputed counterfactual for the treated swings 6.88 -> 2.81 ($000s), a
             $4,070 error against a ~$2,000 ATT, because the treated are massed at ZERO earnings and the
